::  name       aurora living stages equality gate
::  shape      stages - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 exactly when stages is living_stages=6; answers 0 otherwise
::  example    6 -> 1 · 5 -> 0 · 7 -> 0
::  readers    Aurora · Glow Tend a1 unfinished · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e254-equality-third-v0 · STOA337
::
::  Ashvini equality · third pedestal gth cannot speak. The sur shape names
::  six living stages (seed · relay · named · sealed · wire · posted); this
::  gate decides *exactly*, not by a ceiling.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (eq sample 6)  1  0
